{"title": "Banishing Smite", "pageid": 17139, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Banishing_Smite", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 5 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Actions", "Bonus actions", "Sources of Force damage", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp/300px-Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp, /w/images/d/da/Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp/300px-Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Banishing_Smite_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Banishing Smite </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 5 abjuration spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to imbue their weapon with power, dealing force damage and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banishing</a> the target.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banish\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banish</a> your target to another plane of existence. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\">Targets with 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> or more can't be Banished.</span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Cost on hit</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slot</a></dd><dt>Damage: 5~50</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/44px-D10_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/58px-D10_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/D10_Force.png/29px-D10_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/D10_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">5d10</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Normal weapon range\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Normal weapon range</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_Smite_Banishing_Container</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Smite_Banishing_Container\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_Smite_Banishing_Container\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Melee)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Melee)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\">Banishing Smite (Melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Ranged)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/60px-Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/80px-Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Banishing_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Ranged)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Ranged)\">Banishing Smite (Ranged)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Banished\"> Condition: Banished </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banished\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banished</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Banished from this plane of existence.</li>\n<li>Can't be targeted.</li>\n<li>Can't move or take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade</a></li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell can only be learned by <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblade</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Warlocks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Warlocks\">warlocks</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Bards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bards\">bards</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>) despite being a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Paladin spells\">paladin spell</a> in D&amp;D 5e, as <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">paladins</a> do not get access to level 5 spells until level 17 in D&amp;D 5e.</li>\n<li>There is no <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a> for any aspect of this spell.</li>\n<li>If the target is left with 1-49 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> after the damage from the smite is applied, it is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banished\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banished</a> for 2 turns.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">Smite</a> for additional functionality information.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Banishing Smite (Ranged) cast at level 6 incorrectly spends a level 5 spell slot.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3958/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 61649/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23543/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1327629/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n114.89%   94.098     47 Template:Trim\n100.00%   81.905      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   81.905      1 -total\n 26.96%   22.078      3 Template:Cond\n 26.67%   21.847     10 Template:Icon_text\n 24.73%   20.253      8 Template:Icon_link\n 14.87%   12.176      3 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 13.27%   10.869      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.75%   10.440     10 Template:Ifempty\n 10.00%    8.194      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17139-0!canonical and timestamp 2026071503515